{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1784205088,"nonce":"5RbRjozlE5XdqdRl6H1g3/ypock=","title":"2ff6e87 (ADR-0046 epic)","message":"The real GitHub adapter behind ForgePort. App-based auth: sign a JWT with the App private key, exchange for a per-installation access token (~1h), cache and refresh it. Implement the 8 currently-unimplemented!() methods over real HTTP (crates/scarab-forge-github/src/lib.rs:178-225): resolve-ref-to-commit, read/list at ref, post status, deployments, comment, permissions, and mint a contents:read repo-scoped short-TTL token for the ADR-0045 clone credential. Configurable base URL (github.com OR GHES). Pagination + secondary-rate-limit backoff. Auto-register a ForgeConnection from installation / installation_repositories webhooks. Must pass the P2 contract-test suite. Live calls #[ignore]+gated (gh is available for manual verification).\n\n- [ ] App JWT to installation-token exchange with cache + refresh\n- [ ] All 8 ForgePort methods implemented over HTTP; no unimplemented!() remains\n- [ ] Scoped contents:read short-TTL token minting (feeds ADR-0045 S4 / clone)\n- [ ] Base URL configurable (github.com + GHES); pagination + rate-limit backoff\n- [ ] installation webhooks auto-populate a ForgeConnection + its RepoRefs\n- [ ] Passes the shared ForgePort contract test\n\n- 2ee8613 (port shape + contract test)\n- 35cadd8 (ForgeConnection registry)","files":null}]}